        {
          "id": "38de8f50-ef54-4abd-afaa-8acbaf19a9ab",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Me pongo contenta cuando el grupo responde.</strong></p><p>Aqui a boa reação aparece ligada a uma pequena novidade do dia.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/6c834cc37d4945afbfd78db94f519417_l01b05-me-pongo-contenta-cuando-el-grupo-responde.mp3?Expires=1794099578&Signature=gkRyPBR-5uX5xQS5uS-yJCyjsGxuCKmu7Z5WlzSv2PbrPHia1xSrBPQUW13i-mAvSYfYypI~blRCckMlMIJku23eSB77nbtUS35Mor5ojdR-It2TqEIjxp1qapZw7bNjD0As3xS~4-Tz760g9Yay-NtrUHBwCXAMQAOWx8ysSyco24YLc3oD34fbcWtyqPyk0LQrbGmjVGhGABtUxEfjG1BayyWJ3MepIEK1rn-Qwj5UUoiU9A4a0tDpaQ4XRC5ErHYHFUFH2-YJd3f5K8Hs9Ym0BefSt1b433shIm-9xB4ah6t-m-mqvqisAew~YHGv8l44WdyRH5LE-b-0vni2BQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "958b6fbb-f8c6-4ba2-a2c8-d544f1055c02",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Ese ruido me molesta y me enfado enseguida.</strong></p><p>Neste mini-check-in, o gatilho e a irritação entram na mesma atualização.</p>",
